  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.56 Zoning ordinances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.56 “Zoning ordinances” means an ordinance, whether newly enacted or amended, which divides a municipality into zones where different land uses are permitted and regulates different land uses, which complies with RSA 674:16 through RSA 674:18.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea500.html"
